# Mobile (Flutter)

Details: `.cursor/plans/05-flutter-android.md`.

- Flutter/Dart, Riverpod, GoRouter, Dio, secure token storage.
- Same backend API as React; API base URL is build-time configurable.
- Document how physical Android devices reach the backend (LAN IP / emulator `10.0.2.2` / EC2).
- Unit + widget tests; release APK via Makefile with explicit API URL.
- Do not claim APK verification if Flutter SDK is unavailable — mark `BLOCKED`/`IN_REVIEW` with evidence.
